	(text "THE BUS ADDRESS AND THE OUTPUT PORT: SIX TIL311S AND EIGHT LEDS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fd072a86-cefa-5de6-bb8a-6235ef748e8d"))
	(text "J1 is the ribbon from the IO panel card's J3, pin n to pin n. U1-U4 show ADR15-ADR0, the bus address as that card's\ntwo 74HCT573s hold it; U5 / U6 and LED1-LED8 (through RN1, 1k x8) show OUT7-OUT0, its output port (TIL311 strobe\nlow = transparent, blanking low = on)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "164fc045-ac3a-56f7-b4c3-cc02710d4e59"))
